{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Its measurements</b> — its boundaries. And R. Judah the grammarian, may his soul rest, explained: from those of מדד. And it is possible that it is a hint to the measurement of boundaries." "<b>Line</b> — it is the circumference of the earth's roundness."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 38, :notes {0 "Resolved נ\"ע as the abbreviation נוח עדנו, 'may his soul rest.'"}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:58.662559754Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}